{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/About.jpg?t=1744125785\" />A perspective-shifting puzzle game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Find the Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Collect the Tapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Switch Gravity\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfc Over 100 levels\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/ezgif-578994186c621f.gif?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your environmental and spacial awareness to find the key, reach the exit and beat the level. Replay levels as many times as you want to collect everything and record your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/Tapes.jpg?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/tapes.gif?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has 5 tapes to collect in any order, providing an optional challenge for those wishing to push themselves to the limits. Find as many as you can to unlock more levels that provide a greater challenge and reach for 100% completion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/Gravity.jpg?t=1744125785\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/ezgif-493b3d55238107.gif?t=1744125785\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items can only be reached by switching gravity. Levels will often have multiple ways to beat it and switching gravity if often the key.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/Levels.jpg?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/ezgif-4d77be60582c48.gif?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play over 100 mind-bending levels across 8 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/MUSIC.jpg?t=1744125785\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mixtape soundtrack featuring Pizza Hotline, Major Axis, CAIMANS, and many more.\u00a0 Encompassing Drum and Bass, Breakbeat, Synthwave, and more to create an energetic and dreamlike soundtrack.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"AXYZ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/34443d54ff64b80428a05c42fc11fa0657df9a5e.jpg"},{"name":"Purple Echo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5ec0f6de5911b760ebd0c6ef97958605b.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmic Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5ec0f6de5911b760ebd0c6ef97958605b.jpg"},{"name":"no_future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5ec0f6de5911b760ebd0c6ef97958605b.jpg"},{"name":"Neon Heat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5ec0f6de5911b760ebd0c6ef97958605b.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Blossom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5ec0f6de5911b760ebd0c6ef97958605b.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2850490/ba2b31b5